    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rhythm game with a spin:  a rotating 3x3 lane layout. Learn the ropes and relax on accessible lower difficulties, or test your reflexes to the extreme with the highest difficulties.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map includes handmade music synced VFX, adding another level of expression and intensity to the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-game editor to create custom maps, your style. Go all out with intense gameplay and visuals using built in VFX and decoration capabilities, a streamlined workflow, and live preview directly in the editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Initializing delta interface</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rhythm game with a spin:  a rotating 3x3 lane layout. Learn the ropes and relax on accessible lower difficulties, or test your reflexes to the extreme with the highest difficulties.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map includes handmade music synced VFX, adding another level of expression and intensity to the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-game editor to create custom maps, your style. Go all out with intense gameplay and visuals using built in VFX and decoration capabilities, a streamlined workflow, and live preview directly in the editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Initializing delta interface</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "A rhythm game with a unique spin: Spinning. Push your skill to the limit with 3 sets of 3 lanes on a spinning notefield. Featuring a growing roster of songs, VFX in every map, and a powerful editor for custom maps.",
